X-WR-CALNAME:Windrush line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-09T21:15:00&endDate=2026-09-10T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Monday 7\, Tuesday 8\, Wednesday 9 and Thursday 10 September\, after 2215 each evening\, no service between Sydenham and West Croydon. West Croydon trains will divert to and depart from Crystal Palace after 2215. Use local buses via any reasonable route or Southern Railway trains between Sydenham and Norwood Junction. Tickets will also be accepted on Southern Railway trains between Crystal Palace and East Croydon (via Norwood Junction)\, and on two Southern Railway rail replacement buses departing Norwood Junction at 2318 and 0013 for West Croydon via Selhurst (and onward to Sutton). Last through trains: Highbury & Islington to West Croydon 2147\; West Croydon to Highbury & Islington 2246
DTEND:20260910T002900Z
DTSTART:20260909T211500Z
SUMMARY:Windrush line: Part Closure
UID:9b0be4ea-8568-4c90-8190-b5e3c24de07e@9b0b.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-06T18:15:00&endDate=2026-09-07T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Sunday 6 September\, from 1915\, no service between Highbury & Islington and Battersea Park / Clapham Junction / Crystal Palace / New Cross Gate / West Croydon. Use MILDMAY LINE services between Highbury & Islington\, Canonbury and Dalston Kingsland. Use SOUTHERN connections for stations south of New Cross Gate\, and local buses for New Cross\, Penge West and Anerley. Replacement buses operate.
DTEND:20260907T002900Z
DTSTART:20260906T181500Z
SUMMARY:Windrush line: Planned Closure
UID:0ab35fc6-d3e5-4bb5-91d0-f9e5c8f598e4@0ab3.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-29T03:30:00&endDate=2026-09-01T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Saturday 29\, Sunday 30 and Monday 31 August\, no service between Surrey Quays and Clapham Junction / Battersea Park. Replacement bus service M operates between Canada Water and Clapham Junction via Surrey Quays\, Queens Road Peckham\, Peckham Rye\, Denmark Hill\, Clapham High Street and Wandsworth Road. There will also be no SOUTHERN services at Queens Road Peckham and Peckham Rye\, with an additional replacement bus service between London Bridge and Tulse Hill. SOUTHEASTERN and THAMESLINK trains continue to serve Peckham Rye and Denmark Hill.
DTEND:20260901T002900Z
DTSTART:20260829T033000Z
SUMMARY:Windrush line: Part Closure
UID:729d1209-01aa-48b1-b87c-a1a853e03767@729d.org
